  "reference_markdown": "## Quick facts\n\n### Units\n- Force: newton (N)\n- Energy: joule (J)\n- Power: watt (W)\n- Pressure: pascal (Pa)\n\n### Newton's laws\n1. An object stays at rest or in uniform motion unless a force acts on it.\n2. F = ma.\n3. Every action has an equal and opposite reaction.\n\n### Cell organelles\n| Organelle | Job |\n|---|---|\n| Nucleus | Holds most of the DNA |\n| Mitochondrion | Makes ATP |\n| Ribosome | Builds proteins |\n"
